1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
If you freeze this frog,

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,580
its HEART completely STOPS!

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:05,300
Ice spreads through its body,

4
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:06,590
it stops breathing,

5
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:08,550
and it looks completely dead.

6
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:09,685
But its liver releases

7
00:00:09,725 --> 00:00:11,110
massive amounts of sugar,

8
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,005
protecting its cells

9
00:00:12,045 --> 00:00:14,160
while the rest of its body freezes!

10
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,390
It can survive like this for weeks!

11
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:17,670
And when spring arrives,

12
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:18,780
the ice melts,

13
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,610
its heart starts beating again…

14
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:21,760
And it just HOPS AWAY

15
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,180
like nothing happened!

